WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.595
Namaste. Ye naya business type hai: Wholesale aur Distributor.

00:00:04.595 --> 00:00:10.006
Company se MRP par maal aata hai, scheme ke saath, jaise dus plus paanch.

00:00:10.006 --> 00:00:17.714
Retailer ko wholesale rate par, dus plus do scheme ke saath bikta hai, udhaar par, credit days ke saath.

00:00:17.714 --> 00:00:25.571
Salesman route par order leta hai. Ye sab ab app mein hai. Ye Maruti FMCG Distributors ka public demo hai.

00:00:25.909 --> 00:00:28.753
More menu mein Wholesale ka alag hissa.

00:00:28.753 --> 00:00:34.075
Rate list: har item ka MRP, retail rate aur wholesale rate ek screen par.

00:00:34.075 --> 00:00:41.294
Staples chuno, aur wholesale rate MRP se barah pratishat kam, Apply. Saare rate ek saath bhar gaye.

00:00:41.294 --> 00:00:45.960
Save, aur Share se poori rate list scheme ke saath WhatsApp par.

00:01:05.933 --> 00:01:14.944
Har party ke page par Party terms: ye party wholesale rate par leti hai, pandrah din ka udhaar, aur Monday Market Yard beat par hai.

00:01:15.459 --> 00:01:21.125
Company ki scheme. Purchase mein item ki maatra sau, aur Free mein pachaas.

00:01:21.125 --> 00:01:25.582
Stock mein dedh sau aate hain, GST aur laagat sirf sau par.

00:01:25.582 --> 00:01:29.510
Munafe mein har piece ki asli, kam laagat ginti hai.

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:34.806
Ab bikri. New bill par party Sai Kirana, jo wholesale rate leti hai.

00:01:34.806 --> 00:01:42.051
Lux ke barah pack: rate apne aap wholesale ka, aur dus plus do scheme se do free. Paisa sirf dus ka.

00:01:43.906 --> 00:01:49.950
Salesman route par hai to bill nahi, order. Complete bill ke neeche Save as order.

00:01:49.950 --> 00:01:56.437
Order ban gaya, aur Orders mein beat ke hisaab se dikhta hai, salesman ke naam ke saath.

00:01:56.810 --> 00:02:03.033
Maal nikalte waqt ek order par Make bill. Items aur party ka rate pehle se bhare hain.

00:02:03.033 --> 00:02:08.461
Udhaar par bill, aur invoice par Due by, party ke credit days ke hisaab se.

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:15.961
Vasooli ke liye Payments due. Kitna lena hai, kitna overdue, har party ke kaunse bill kitne din se late.

00:02:15.961 --> 00:02:21.721
Beat chuno, aur salesman usi route ki list lekar jaaye. WhatsApp par bill-wise yaad.

00:02:22.089 --> 00:02:26.297
Aur Scheme report, aapki dus plus paanch, dus plus do wali baat.

00:02:26.297 --> 00:02:32.150
Company se kitna free aaya, parties ko kitna diya, kitna bacha, aur bache maal ki keemat.

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:34.780
Saath mein khareed rate aur asli laagat.

00:02:40.114 --> 00:02:54.002
To distributor ke liye: MRP se rate list, party-wise rate, company aur party ki scheme, salesman ka order, due date ke saath udhaar, beat-wise vasooli, aur scheme ka munafa.

00:02:54.002 --> 00:02:54.885
Dhanyavaad.
